  m_text: "CONTROLS:\n\u2022 Move: WASD or Arrow Keys\n\nOBJECTIVE:\n\u2022 Protect
    the central Yurt from invading predators!\n\nENEMIES:\n\u2022 Wolf (Blue): Fast,
    takes 1 hit to repel (+5 pts)\n\u2022 Bear (Brown): Heavy, takes 2 hits to defeat
    (+5 pts, deals 2 damage)\n\nITEMS & BUFFS:\n\u2022 Aaruul (Yellow Token): 1-Hit
    Shield (absorbs 1 strike)\n\u2022 Spirit Bell (Cyan Token): 10-Second Immunity
    (blinks before ending)"
